COMMENTING ON THE PAGE (user, Oct 12 2026)
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

  Every row of logs/summary.html has a comment box. Type under any row
  (an empty box means no change); a box with text turns amber, and the
  bar at the top counts them. Comments stay in the browser (per suite)
  until "Clear all", so the page can be closed and reopened, and they
  survive a rerun of the suite.
    Copy all comments   copies them as text, to paste into the chat
    Save as file        writes test_createpts_comments.txt to Downloads
  Each comment is written with its row's name and result, so it can be
  matched to its deck.

