OLD DECKS

  DECKS.txt (written by make_decks.py) lists this suite's decks. Any
  other cp*.lgi, e.g. an old deck left behind when a newer archive was
  unpacked over an older one (tar adds and replaces files, it never
  deletes), is not run; the runner names it and prints the rm command.

ADDING A TEST

  The decks are written by make_decks.py (one case() per deck; numbers
  follow the group order). Add or change a case() there and run
  python3 make_decks.py, rather than editing a cpNN deck by hand.

  Copy a deck of the same group, change the createpts line and its
  "# spec" (the same numbers, in the checker's words: see
  check_createpts.py), keep every name within 32 characters and every
  line within 80. For
  behaviour the documentation does not settle, add "# open : ...";
  for a bug, "# known : ..." and a FOUND note.

